{"study_accession":"PRJNA381146","secondary_study_accession":"SRP102809","title":"Transcriptomic signature in patients with systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE) [CD8 T cells]","description":"T cell abnormalities are well-known features of patients with systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE). The role of CD4 and CD8 T lymphocytes, however, remains poorly understood with data suggesting both protective and deleterious roles. This project aimed to identify a cell-specific transcriptional signature in patients with SLE that could be used as a prognostic disease marker. The overall objective is to correlate the clinical presentation with specific RNA signatures to determine if there are signatures that correlate with disease outcome Overall design: mRNA extraction from isolated blood CD8+ T cells from 16 SLE with active disease, 18 SLE with less active disease and 14 controls. RNA signatures will be correlated with the clinical presentation","pubmed":"33790300","geo_series":"","n_samples":48,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN06670873","study_accession":"PRJNA381146","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Ctrl_LHC-12_IGF0005576","description":"Ctrl_LHC-12_IGF0005576","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM2560370","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-02-13","attributes":[["source_name","Ctrl_Peripheral blood"],["disease","Ctrl"],["tissue","Blood"],["cell_type","CD 8 T cell"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR5398427","experiment_accession":"SRX2693173","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":36229218,"base_count":7245843600,"first_public":"2021-02-13","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2560370: Ctrl_LHC-12_IGF0005576 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN06670874","study_accession":"PRJNA381146","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Ctrl_LHC-9_IGF0005575","description":"Ctrl_LHC-9_IGF